WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
The real Hotshot editor displays a generated checkout capture with an arrow, rectangle, and text annotation.

00:04.500 --> 00:08.500
Selecting another filename loads the baseline image directly in the native editor.

00:08.500 --> 00:13.100
Selecting the review filename restores its editable annotations. The recording contains no audio.
